<Legal lang="en" title="Privacy policy" updated="Last updated: September 2026">
  <h2>Who handles your data</h2>
  <p>
    The controller is <strong>{site.legalName}</strong>, registered office
    <span class="todo">TODO: registered office</span>, company number
    <span class="todo">TODO: IČO</span>, premises at {site.address.street},
    {site.address.zip} {site.address.city}.
  </p>
  <p>
    Reach us at <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> or
    <a href={`tel:${site.phone}`}>{site.phoneDisplay}</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <p>Only what a table booking needs:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>your name,</li>
    <li>phone number,</li>
    <li>email address,</li>
    <li>date, time and number of guests,</li>
    <li>a note, if you write one.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    We also store a hashed fingerprint of your IP address. It exists solely to
    keep bots out of the form and cannot be turned back into your IP address.
  </p>

  <h2>Why we process it</h2>
  <p>
    To handle your booking and send you the confirmation. The legal basis is
    <strong>performance of a contract</strong> under Art. 6(1)(b) GDPR.
    Protecting the form from abuse rests on our legitimate interest under (f).
  </p>
  <p>We do not send marketing and we do not share your details for it.</p>

  <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
  <p>
    Personal details are erased <strong>30 days</strong> after the booking date.
    What remains is an anonymous record with no name or contact: date, time,
    party size and outcome, which tells us how many tables to plan for. That
    record is deleted after one year.
  </p>

  <h2>Who else sees it</h2>
  <p>
    The site runs on infrastructure operated by <strong>Cloudflare, Inc.</strong>,
    acting as our processor. Data may be processed outside the European Union
    under the European Commission's Standard Contractual Clauses and the EU-US
    Data Privacy Framework.
  </p>
  <p>Nobody else. We use no Google Analytics and no other tracking tools.</p>

  <h2>Cookies</h2>
  <p>
    No analytics or advertising cookies, which is why we never ask you about
    them. We store one technical item in your browser: whether you chose the
    light or dark appearance. It stays on your device.
  </p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>You may ask us at any time for:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>access to the data we hold about you,</li>
    <li>correction,</li>
    <li>erasure,</li>
    <li>restriction of processing,</li>
    <li>portability,</li>
    <li>objection to processing based on legitimate interest.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    Write to <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> and we will reply
    within a month. You may also complain to the
    <a href="https://uoou.gov.cz/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
      Czech Data Protection Authority
    </a>.
  </p>
</Legal>
